<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="11">### 1. Introduction</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="12">Welcome to **Habit Hero: RPG Habit Tracker** ("the App"), developed by **funbucket** ("we", "us", or "our"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any information associated with your use of our App.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="14">This Privacy Policy explains how our App handles information, what data third-party service providers may process, and your rights regarding your data.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="16">---</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="18">### 2. Information We Do NOT Collect</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="19">* **Personal Habits, Tasks, and Routine Data**: All your habits, daily quests, to-do lists, streaks, character level, pets, gold, and game progress are stored **100% locally on your device** using local SQLite database storage. We do not transmit, sync, or store your personal habit records on our private servers.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="20">* **Account Credentials**: You do not need an account or login to use Habit Hero. We do not collect your name, email address, phone number, or passwords.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="21">* **Location Data**: We do not request, track, or collect your GPS coordinates or precise location.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="23">---</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="25">### 3. Information Collected by Third-Party Services</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="26">To provide in-app advertising and optional in-app purchases, we integrate trusted third-party SDKs provided by Google:</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="28">#### A. Google Mobile Ads (AdMob)</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="29">We use Google AdMob to display banner, interstitial, and rewarded video advertisements. AdMob may collect and process:</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="30">* Device identifiers (such as the Google Advertising ID / AAID).</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="31">* IP address and coarse network location (city/country level).</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="32">* Ad interaction data (ad views, clicks, and impressions).</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="33">* Diagnostic information for fraud prevention and performance analysis.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="35">You can learn more about how Google processes information by visiting [Google Privacy &amp; Terms](https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads). You can also reset or opt out of personalized ads at any time via your Android device settings (**Settings &amp;rarr; Google &amp;rarr; Ads &amp;rarr; Delete Advertising ID**).</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="37">#### B. Google Play In-App Billing</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="38">We use Google Play's native Billing service to process optional purchases (e.g., Starter Bundles, Streak Shields, and Remove Ads Lifetime Pass).</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="39">* Financial data (credit card numbers, billing addresses) is collected and processed **exclusively by Google LLC**.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="40">* We never see, receive, or store your payment card details.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="41">* The App receives an anonymous purchase token from Google Play to unlock the corresponding in-game perks.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="43">---</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="45">### 4. Data Security &amp; Storage</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="46">* **Encrypted in Transit**: All network requests initiated by Google AdMob and Google Play Billing utilize industry-standard Transport Layer Security (TLS/HTTPS) encryption.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="47">* **Local Database Protection**: Your local database (`habithero.db`) is protected by Android application sandboxing, meaning other apps on your device cannot access your habit data without system root access.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="48">* **Backup Rules**: The App participates in Android Cloud Backup with explicit encryption rules, allowing you to restore your habit progress when switching devices using your personal Google account.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="50">---</div>
</div>
