<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="52">### 5. Children's Privacy (COPPA Compliance)</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="53">Habit Hero is intended for a general audience aged **13 and older**. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If you believe a child under 13 has provided personal data through third-party ad networks, please contact us at **vinay.tikkiwal1@gmail.com**, and we will promptly investigate and take necessary measures.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="55">---</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="57">### 6. Data Deletion Rights</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="58">Because your habit and character data is stored locally on your device, you have complete control over your data:</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="59">* You can delete all your stored data at any time by going to your device's **Settings &amp;rarr; Apps &amp;rarr; Habit Hero &amp;rarr; Storage &amp;rarr; Clear Data**.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
<div>
<div class="react-file-line html-div" data-testid="code-cell" data-line-number="60">* Uninstalling the application will permanently delete all local habit databases and preferences.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="react-code-text react-code-line-contents">
